# Secrets — NEVER commit. See .env.example for the required keys.
.env
*.pem
token.json
credentials.json

# Unscrubbed source emails straight out of David's mailbox. The scrubbed,
# committable copies live in tests/fixtures/. These originals still contain his
# real address and LinkedIn's per-recipient signed tokens — keep them local.
docs/

# Session transcripts dropped in the repo root while working. They quote code,
# real contact names and mailbox addresses verbatim — same reasoning as docs/.
recall-*.txt

# Screenshots shared while debugging setup. They are photos of live mail and
# console screens — addresses, settings, sometimes tokens in view.
IMG_*.HEIC
IMG_*.heic
IMG_*.PNG
IMG_*.jpg
IMG_*.jpeg
Screenshot*.png

# Local database + runtime state (production lives on a mounted volume)
data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/

# macOS
.DS_Store
._*

# Internal rules + engagement notes. Names the client relationship, pricing
# posture and open business decisions — stays on the build machine, never in a
# repo an outside collaborator can read.
RULES.md

